    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Roll on the @UUID[Compendium.mmm.mmmm.RollTable.iP8lOROAIYARwcgk]{Large Limb Table}. The limb is charred black, completely covered in extensive burns, and <strong>nonfunctional</strong>. If untreated within 24 hours the limb will necrotize and fall off in [[1d4]] days (after which it is <strong>missing</strong>).</p><p><em>Treatment</em> - A DC 21 Save Limb Surgery. You get 1 check for this surgery; if you do not meet the DC on the first check, the limb is lost.</p>",
